        "raw": "<p>Hello!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I was wondering if there would be a chance that GTG would include form fillable PDF character sheets&nbsp;as part of the benefits to the kickstarter? ( including the option to paste an image into where is the character image would be)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;If not would&nbsp;they consider allowing us to use their PDF with the character sheet that&nbsp;comes out to create one and put it online for sharing for free?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In our group we have laminated the character sheets for the starter kit so they work with erasable markers as well, it&nbsp;makes a slick professional looking character sheet and allows us to reuse it over and over again. &nbsp; Would be cool after people made their characters to be able to make a professional looking sheet for them as well!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;I appreciate GTG&nbsp;thinking about this! Keep being awesome!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
